=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"f2: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> f2.<span class=\"me1\">get</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>waiting... 1.61803 seconds\nf1: 102334155\nf2: 433494437</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/future/wait_for\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>wait_for</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  waits for the result, returns if it is not available for the specified timeout duration <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/future/wait_until\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>wait_until</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  waits for the result, returns if it is not available until specified time point has been reached <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"thread","title":"Concurrency support library (since C++11)"},{"path":"thread/future","title":"std::future"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::future<T>::wait","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Blocks until the result becomes available. valid() == true after the call."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{